>> phrases := ליסטע ניי
	~ ⌝'abcd'⌜
	~ ⌝'hello world'⌜
	~ ⌝''⌜
	~ ⌝'@.,;"'⌜
	~ ⌝'this is a much much longer string to be encoded!'⌜.

>> message := ⌝'Phrase: ~decoded base64: ~encoded'⌜.
	
phrases יעדער: ⎬ :_ :phrase 
	>> e := Server base64-קאָדירן: phrase.
	>> d := Server base64-דעקאָדירן: e.
	אויסגאָב שרײַב: ﴿
		message קאָפּיר ~encoded: e, ~decoded: d
	﴾, נײַע-שורה.
⎨.
